MultiFrameYOLO
=============

Multi-frame fused weed/root-point detection built on a PyTorch
YOLOv8-pose re-implementation.

The following parts are derived from third-party open-source software:

* `YOLOv8-pose/` (nets/, utils/, main.py) is a modified copy of
  jahongir7174/YOLOv8-pose
  (https://github.com/jahongir7174/YOLOv8-pose), itself a PyTorch
  re-implementation of Ultralytics YOLOv8-pose. Upstream license:
  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.

The rest of this repository (multi-frame fusion model, training and
evaluation code) is distributed under the same AGPL-3.0 license that
covers the derived base, as stated in the top-level LICENSE file.

Original copyright and license notices of the upstream project are
preserved in `YOLOv8-pose/LICENSE`.
